1
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:20,360
Madam.

2
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,240
After receiving the order,

3
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:25,450
Third Young Master has been kneeling outside all night.

4
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,800
He still hasn't left,

5
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,160
saying he must see you today.

6
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,440
Let him in.

7
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:43,360
Yes.

8
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,120
Mother.

9
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:01,240
Mother, please dismiss the attendants.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,330
I have something to say.

11
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:10,920
Mother.

12
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:14,680
That Daoist priest's background is unknown.

13
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:16,400
Please let me investigate him thoroughly

14
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:17,930
before you make a decision.

15
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,080
This order

16
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:21,000
was given by your father.

17
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:23,039
I also want to help you,

18
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,600
but I'm afraid

19
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:27,880
there is no room for maneuver now.

20
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,320
Mother, you normally

21
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,960
know Father's mind best.

22
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,479
If you,

23
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:33,680
speak for me,

24
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:34,660
perhaps...

25
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,600
If I do that,

26
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,800
your father will surely detest me.

27
00:01:42,039 --> 00:01:43,720
You really know how to

28
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,479
sow discord.

29
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:48,810
I wouldn't dare.

30
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:51,840
I am completely loyal to you.

31
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:53,440
I meant no such thing.

32
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,720
When I was eight,

33
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,920
I was humiliated in the academy.

34
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,570
Those sons of officials

35
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,960
pushed me into the snow

36
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:07,730
and insulted me,

37
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:09,600
calling me a servant's bastard.

38
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,800
It was you who appeared in time

39
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,080
and protected me behind you.

40
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,010
I still remember

41
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,400
what you said.

42
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,800
This child

43
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:20,480
will be of the Li family's bloodline from now on.

44
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:21,940
Whoever dares to touch him

45
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:25,020
will be making an enemy of my Qiwu Courtyard.

46
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,240
This kindness,

47
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,880
I remember every day.

48
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,520
Mother.

49
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,220
I know very well

50
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,160
that the women you and Father

51
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,840
chose for me

52
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:39,400
are all noble ladies.

53
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,520
But I

54
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,079
am already a cripple

55
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,200
who can hardly achieve my ambitions.

56
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,730
I don't seek fame or wealth.

57
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:53,160
I only want to find Qingcheng

58
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:55,220
and spend the rest of my life with her.

59
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,480
Please have pity on me, Mother,

60
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:00,040
and grant this marriage.

61
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,000
Mother.

62
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:04,080
Mother.

63
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:14,000
Madam.

64
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,440
I thought

65
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:17,320
our Third Young Master

66
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:19,650
was just looking for a substitute for fun.

67
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,000
Now it seems

68
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:23,360
he has real feelings for her.

69
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,280
If Third Young Master

70
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,730
really cares for that Fang Qingcheng,

71
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:32,160
then that old card in your hand,

72
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:32,840
I'm afraid,

73
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:35,170
will not be as effective as before.

74
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,800
There is one thing

75
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,680
he reminded me of.

76
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,130
A merchant's daughter,

77
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,680
no matter what,

78
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,860
can't turn the world upside down.

79
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,850
Even if he really falls for her,

80
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,540
they'll be easy for us to control.

81
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,560
If he uses marriage

82
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:55,120
to connect with a noble lady,

83
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,880
gains their support,

84
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:59,940
and coaxes the Commander into favoring him,

85
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:02,280
then we'll be in real trouble.

86
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,920
I have built up

87
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:06,040
a lot of old grudges against him

88
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,840
and his lowly mother.

89
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:11,100
We can never let him have a chance to turn the tables.

90
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,980
What about the Commander?

91
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:16,800
Over the years, the Commander

92
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,200
has increasingly believed in divination.

93
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:20,899
Tell the Grand Diviner

94
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,920
to find an excuse

95
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,420
and come to the mansion immediately.

96
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,240
Yes.

97
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,200
Dear Zhuozhuo,

98
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,440
I have left Kuizhou tonight as promised.

99
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:41,840
I hope when we meet again,

100
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,040
there will be no more shackles in your heart.

101
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,320
Follow your heart.

102
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:46,280
Take care.

103
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:46,960
Jiaojiao.

104
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:47,920
Granny.

105
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,520
Tell me.

106
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:53,100
If there were no Zuirong Sect,

107
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:54,920
would Kuizhou

108
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:57,100
be a completely different place?

109
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:58,720
Mind your words, Miss.

110
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,680
If someone else hears this,

111
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,080
you could lose your head.

112
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,600
Over the years,

113
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:09,460
I've been trapped in the identity of Qingcheng.

114
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,820
But I am Fang Zhuozhuo,

115
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,850
not Fang Qingcheng.

116
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:19,760
If there were really no such dogmas,

117
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:21,640
maybe I could really

118
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,760
follow my heart.

119
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,200
Miss.

120
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:28,880
Never mind.

121
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,850
I was overthinking.

122
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,960
How can anyone in this world

123
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:34,560
truly do whatever they want?

124
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:36,400
I was daydreaming.

125
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:38,560
Let's eat.

126
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,400
Okay, let's eat.

127
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:44,640
Hurry, hurry.

128
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,440
Hurry.

129
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:50,840
What are you doing?

130
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:52,040
Put everything down.

131
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:52,840
What are you doing?

132
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:53,700
Fang Zhuozhuo,

133
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:55,040
what are you up to now?

134
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,080
I just went to check the Qionghua seeds.

135
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,210
They are withering.

136
00:05:58,280 --> 00:06:00,480
If we don't think of a way, they will die.

137
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:03,280
Do you know that Qionghua can't tolerate foul air?

138
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:06,040
Besides, I've never heard Mother say this.

139
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,060
Look at these flowers.

140
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,280
We water them every day,

141
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,940
but they wither more each day.

142
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,640
There are some strange trees in this world.

143
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,720
Before they break the soil,

144
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,760
they must first devour the surrounding life force.

145
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:18,080
I guess Qionghua is like that.

146
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,360
There is no record of planting Qionghua.

147
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,960
If we don't take a risk this time

148
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:24,620
and just plant them as before,

149
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:25,120
you,

150
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:25,960
me,

151
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:27,520
and the whole mansion

152
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,240
will hardly survive.

153
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,040
My lady, the flowers.

154
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,800
Do you want to trust me this once?

155
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:45,120
Hurry,

156
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,730
plant them all back.

157
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:51,240
Quickly plant all these flowers around the Qionghua.

158
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,080
Someone come!

159
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,120
Master.

160
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,040
Prepare some food and drinks.

161
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:05,440
Yes.

162
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:32,120
The kitchen was preparing ingredients for the Mid-Autumn Festival.

163
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,840
I saw some ready-made ones,

164
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:36,090
so I took the liberty of steaming them.

165
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,680
They're not as good as Granny Lan's.

166
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,050
Have a cup of tea.

167
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:42,570
You've worked hard.

168
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:53,180
No matter how good the cook is,

169
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,860
it's not the same taste as before.

170
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:58,360
How is your letter of divorce

171
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,680
coming along?

172
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:04,080
I might have to disappoint you, my lady.

173
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,480
That Taoist's appearance was suspicious.

174
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:10,080
Although it took some effort,

175
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:10,920
I still found

176
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,560
the Taoist's clothes

177
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,860
in a dark shop in the black market.

178
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,840
Besides the clothes,

179
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:20,610
there were also some women's daily necessities.

180
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:28,680
Today, I went to pay my respects to my father

181
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:32,210
and happened to run into the Grand Diviner coming to see him.

182
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:35,440
I had my doubts,

183
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:37,530
so I asked for another divination.

184
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:39,960
Guess what the result was, my lady.

185
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,330
Judging from your expression,

186
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:46,400
it must be a very good omen.

187
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:51,020
Your cousin's birth chart

188
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,490
and mine are an auspicious sign together.

189
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:56,160
Not only can it increase the luck of the Langjun Mansion,

190
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:58,080
but it will also help the fortune of Kuizhou.

191
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,480
My father was overjoyed to hear this

192
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:01,540
and immediately withdrew his order.

193
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:11,620
The young mistress of my Langjun Mansion

194
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:15,010
will probably be none other than your cousin.

195
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:17,530
Chu Shengyi.

196
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,760
Maybe my cousin's life

197
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:21,250
is worth nothing to you.

198
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,040
But to me,

199
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,700
she is the most important person.

200
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,250
It broke ground.

201
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,760
As promised,

202
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:01,480
when the Qiong flower blooms,

203
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,610
Qingcheng appears.

204
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,650
You're so smart, Young Master.

205
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:32,800
You knew Lady Fang would come to steal the flower tonight,

206
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:35,260
so you sent Lady Li's guards away in advance.

207
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:39,920
I was about to move the flower to Qiwu Courtyard.

208
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,450
Tonight is her last chance.

209
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,120
She stayed up for three nights

210
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,580
to fix the bracelet for me.

211
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:48,040
I promised her the Qiong flower,

212
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,570
so I should keep my promise.

213
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:03,360
The poison from this Qiong flower rouge

214
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:04,600
is getting stronger.

215
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:07,660
Even if I succeed this time...

216
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:14,000
Miss.

217
00:12:16,560 --> 00:12:17,690
I've lost the tails.

218
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,900
The place you found

219
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:23,520
is indeed a good hiding spot.

220
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:26,280
On the day of the preliminary selection for the Makeup Ceremony,

221
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:28,040
Chu Shengyi will definitely set a trap.

222
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:29,770
It's his best chance to strike.

223
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,840
But if he fails to catch Qingcheng,

224
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,480
he will definitely take his anger out on me again.

225
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:34,810
As for Langjun Mansion,

226
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:37,740
I'm afraid we won't be able to return for a while.

227
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:43,820
How is the rouge making going?

228
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,560
This is my first time making it,

229
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:49,220
so I still need to experiment.

230
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:50,400
The proportions

231
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:52,000
might still need adjusting.

232
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:54,520
The transformation duration of the rouge

233
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:56,320
is getting shorter and shorter.

234
00:12:58,160 --> 00:13:00,760
Is it because there is not enough Qiong flower?

235
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:03,400
I will try again.

236
00:13:06,400 --> 00:13:09,200
The preliminary selection of the Makeup Ceremony

237
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:10,770
is only three days away.

238
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:20,160
Hurry up. Let's go.

239
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:23,200
Hurry.

240
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,880
The Master of Peixi Pavilion

241
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,690
has arrived.

242
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:34,450
The Master of Linlang Pavilion

243
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:35,370
has arrived.

244
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:38,050
The Master of Xiangyun Pavilion has arrived.

245
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:40,120
The Master of Yanzhi Pavilion.

246
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:45,040
The Master of Yanzhi Pavilion.

247
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:48,680
You can't forfeit.

248
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:54,240
The competition is about to begin.

249
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:57,080
Since the Master of Yanzhi Pavilion is absent,

250
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,360
her qualification is revoked.

251
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:00,000
Why hasn't the Master arrived yet?

252
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:00,760
Wait.

253
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:15,120
I, Fang Qingcheng, am late.

254
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:16,970
Please forgive me, Chief Dian.

255
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:23,440
Lady Li has ordered.

256
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:25,840
Spring brings blooming flowers.

257
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:28,280
Please show your skills

258
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:29,720
using flowers as the theme

259
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:31,880
to paint the elegance of Kuizhou.

260
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:32,680
Yes.

261
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:54,200
Fang Qingcheng is here as expected.

262
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:56,730
Where Qionghua appears, Qingcheng follows.

263
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:57,880
Interesting.

264
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:01,100
Give the order.

265
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,960
Once the preliminary ends,

266
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,360
arrest her immediately.

267
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:05,320
Yes.

268
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:07,850
Fang Qingcheng,

269
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:10,130
in order to save Xin'er,

270
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:11,760
I am sorry.
